# Third-party notices

emquad is MIT licensed. `@emquad/core` ships a prebuilt native binary that
statically links the Rust crates below — Typst among them, which is Apache-2.0
— so their license terms travel with the binary and the full text of each is
reproduced here to satisfy that obligation.

**Do not edit this file by hand.** Regenerate it with `pnpm notices`
(`cargo about generate --output-file THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES.md about.hbs`).

Fonts are not covered here. `@emquad/fonts` is a separate optional package whose
files span four licenses, one of them GPL-3.0-or-later. See
[LICENSING.md](LICENSING.md).

